WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.169 --> 00:00:16.750
they put on their sandals, Mandy realized something.

2
00:00:16.770 --> 00:00:22.413
"Seiko, we have no money to buy these," she said.

3
00:00:22.433 --> 00:00:26.495
"It is a gift," said Seiko.

4
00:00:27.955 --> 00:00:31.901
She said good-bye to her aunt and picked up her basket of flowers.

5
00:00:33.441 --> 00:00:35.142
They went back onto the street.

6
00:00:35.162 --> 00:00:40.944
"Did you come to Sendai with Shogun Ieyasu?"

7
00:00:41.405 --> 00:00:42.285
asked Seiko.

8
00:00:42.305 --> 00:00:44.766
"Who's he?"

9
00:00:45.306 --> 00:00:47.747
asked Vinnie, forgetting about the general.

10
00:00:48.848 --> 00:00:55.350
Seiko looked at him strangely and said, "You do not know Shogun Ieyasu?"

11
00:00:57.291 --> 00:01:01.269
"Well, oh sure," said Vinnie nervously.

12
00:01:01.289 --> 00:01:08.071
"The shogun has come a long way to see Daimyo Masamune," said Seiko.

13
00:01:08.091 --> 00:01:11.193
"Why?" asked Mandy.

14
00:01:11.213 --> 00:01:19.116
"The shogun likes to visit all the daimyos in every district," she said, "to make sure they are

15
00:01:19.216 --> 00:01:20.296
obeying his orders."

16
00:01:21.957 --> 00:01:23.538
"What's going on over there?"

17
00:01:24.758 --> 00:01:28.480
Vinnie pointed to a crowd buying colorful strips of paper.

18
00:01:29.668 --> 00:01:33.371
"People are getting ready for the Star Festival," Seiko said.

19
00:01:33.391 --> 00:01:38.354
"Sendai celebrates the festival better than any other town!"

20
00:01:38.374 --> 00:01:41.977
"Why are they decorating those trees?"

21
00:01:43.578 --> 00:01:50.103
Mandy noticed bamboo trees along the street with shiny pieces of paper hanging from their branches.

22
00:01:50.123 --> 00:01:57.168
"People write their wishes on paper and then tie them to the trees," explained Seiko.

23
00:01:58.520 --> 00:02:01.883
"The wind carries their wishes away and makes them come true."

24
00:02:03.565 --> 00:02:07.008
Seiko turned into a small street off the main road.

25
00:02:08.249 --> 00:02:09.410
The children followed.

26
00:02:10.831 --> 00:02:15.515
They finally came to a narrow road with two-story buildings on each side.

27
00:02:15.535 --> 00:02:19.599
"This is where I live," said Seiko.

28
00:02:20.980 --> 00:02:25.044
Bright and colorful fabrics hung from poles along the rooftops.

29
00:02:26.300 --> 00:02:28.602
They swayed with each gentle breeze.

30
00:02:28.622 --> 00:02:31.664
"What is this place?"

31
00:02:32.324 --> 00:02:32.985
asked Vinnie.

32
00:02:33.005 --> 00:02:36.347
"It's my home and a dye factory.

33
00:02:37.748 --> 00:02:40.489
My family and another family all work together.

34
00:02:41.770 --> 00:02:47.374
We make the most beautiful kimono in all of Sendai," Seiko said proudly.

35
00:02:48.615 --> 00:02:50.356
She took them inside her home.

36
00:02:51.440 --> 00:02:56.563
Seiko's parents and her brother were stirring the dyed cloth in large wooden vats.

37
00:02:56.583 --> 00:03:02.166
"The flowers I picked will be used to dye the fabric," said Seiko.

38
00:03:03.407 --> 00:03:05.528
She handed the flowers to her father.

39
00:03:05.548 --> 00:03:08.409
"What kind of flowers are they?"

40
00:03:08.930 --> 00:03:09.670
asked Mandy.

41
00:03:09.690 --> 00:03:14.173
"They are called safflowers," said Seiko.

42
00:03:15.493 --> 00:03:17.474
Mandy touched the dyed fabric.

43
00:03:18.755 --> 00:03:20.256
It felt soft and smooth.

44
00:03:20.988 --> 00:03:23.190
Seiko's mother spoke to her daughter.

45
00:03:23.210 --> 00:03:28.355
"My mother will bring you some food and drink," said Seiko.

46
00:03:28.375 --> 00:03:31.557
"Thank you," said Vinnie.

47
00:03:32.618 --> 00:03:35.561
He remembered the rice at Master Masamune's house.

48
00:03:37.002 --> 00:03:38.383
It had looked very good.

49
00:03:39.684 --> 00:03:44.368
A few minutes later Seiko's mother appeared with two bowls on a tray.

50
00:03:44.388 --> 00:03:46.650
"Is that rice?"

51
00:03:47.111 --> 00:03:48.412
Vinnie asked eagerly.

52
00:03:49.828 --> 00:03:51.489
Seiko's mother bowed to them.

53
00:03:51.509 --> 00:03:53.751
"I apologize.

54
00:03:54.071 --> 00:03:56.252
Only samurai are allowed to have rice.

55
00:03:57.573 --> 00:03:58.994
I can only offer porridge."

56
00:04:00.435 --> 00:04:02.837
Vinnie felt embarrassed for wanting rice.

57
00:04:03.978 --> 00:04:07.000
He took the bowls and bowed to Seiko's mother.

58
00:04:07.020 --> 00:04:10.382
"This looks delicious!"

59
00:04:10.842 --> 00:04:11.342
he said.

60
00:04:11.362 --> 00:04:13.984
"Thank you very much."
